        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Sets the maximum cache size that can be persistent across build, in terms of percentage of the available space on the disk. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Set to 100 to indicate no limit, 50 to indicate that the cache size will not be left over half the available space. A value over 100 will be reduced to 100, and a value of 0 will be ignored.</para>
<para>The formula looks like: AvailableSpace = FreeSpace + ExistingCacheSize NewCacheSize = AvailableSpace * P/100 </para>
